# The dev fixtures: the 42-record sample and any scaled copy of it
# (dev-data-10k and friends). Wildcarded because the -10k directory fell
# outside a bare `dev-data/` rule and a 28 MB VCF was committed by accident.
dev-data*/
# Upload staging dirs. `mkdtemp(dir=NF_WORK_DIR)` lands in the *cwd* when
# NF_WORK_DIR is unset, and the suite runs from either the repo root or app/,
# so they turn up at both depths.
tmp*/

# Rendered exports of the design diagrams. The .py generators and the .html they
# emit are the source of truth; the images are just for pasting into slides and
# docs, and re-rendering them on every tweak would bloat history.
app/vep/docs/design/*.jpg
app/vep/docs/design/*.png
